"2026-04-21T03:09:18Z","assignee":{"login":"karthickai","id":33245270,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMjQ1Mjcw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33245270?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/karthickai","html_url":"https://github.com/karthickai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karthickai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karthickai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karthickai/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karthickai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karthickai/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karthickai/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karthickai/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karthickai/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karthickai/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### 🐛 Describe the bug\n\nWhen compiling a function containing Tensor.expand() followed by a broadcasted index put (e.g., expanded[0, 1] = 1), torch.compile produces inconsistent output compared to eager.\n\nThis issue disappears if the index put is not broadcasted (i.e., `expanded[0, 1, 1]=1`).\n\nTo reproduce:\n```python\nimport torch\ntorch.manual_seed(0)\n\n\ndef fn(x, y):\n    z = x @ y\n    expanded = x.expand(1, 2, 4)\n    expanded[0, 1] = 1\n    return z\n\ncfunc = torch.compile(fn, backend='inductor')\n\nx1 = torch.randn(1, 2, 4, dtype=torch.float32)\ny1 = torch.randn(1, 4, 4, dtype=torch.float32)\nx2 = x1.clone()\ny2 = y1.clone()\nout1 = fn(x1, y1)\nout2 = cfunc(x2, y2)\n\ntorch.testing.assert_close(out1, out2, equal_nan=True)\n\n```\n\nIt seems that, the broadcasted index put is incorrectly applied to `z` under torch.compile. Maybe it is an issue during functionalization?\n\nNote that backend `eager` and `aot_eager` do to have this issue.\n\n\n### Error logs\n\nAssertionError: Tensor-likes are not close!\n\nMismatched elements: 4 / 8 (50.0%)\nGreatest absolute difference: 7.357644081115723 at index (0, 1, 1) (up to 1e-05 allowed)\nGreatest relative difference: 3.269789218902588 at index (0, 1, 1) (up to 1.3e-06 allowed)\n\n### Versions\n\n[pip3] numpy==2.4.2\n[pip3] torch==2.12.0.dev20260223+cpu\n[pip3] torchvision==0.26.0.dev20260223+cpu\n[pip3] triton==3.6.0\n[conda] numpy 2.4.2 pypi_0 pypi\n[conda] torch 2.12.0.dev20260223+cpu pypi_0 pypi\n[conda] torchvision 0.26.0.dev20260223+cpu pypi_0 pypi\n[conda] triton 3.6.0 pypi_0 pypi\n\ncc @ezyang @gchanan @kadeng @msaroufim @chauhang @penguinwu @voznesenskym @EikanWang @jgong5 @Guobing-Chen @XiaobingSuper @zhuhaozhe @blzheng @wenzhe-nrv @jiayisunx @ipiszy @muchulee8 @amjames @aakhundov @coconutruben @jataylo","closed_by":{"login":"karthickai","id":33245270,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMjQ1Mjcw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33245270?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/karthickai","html_url":"https://github.com/karthickai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karthickai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karthickai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karthickai/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karthickai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karthickai/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karthickai/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karthickai/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karthickai/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karthickai/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pytorch/pytorch/issues/175791/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pytorch/pytorch/issues/175791/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}